// Base configuration of Debug-dev, Debug-stg and Debug-prod. All three share the
// pods settings of the "Debug" pods configuration (kept in the Podfile for this
// reason); they are identical per flavor while no pod is limited to specific
// configurations. CocoaPods cannot see that and would warn once per flavor
// configuration that integration "will not work", so the token below silences it.
